    "specPath": "specs/054-npm-rustev-scope/spec.md",
    "status": "approved",
    "summary": "A narrow amendment of approved specs 027 and 031. Both specs named the npm packages under the `@statecrafting` scope and recorded that whether that scope could be used was not established. The owner publishes Rustev under the npm organization `rustev` (2026-10-25). This spec moves every npm package from `@statecrafting/` to `@rustev/` and changes nothing else: the native package `@rustev/rustev`, its platform packages `@rustev/rustev-<platform>`, and the WebAssembly package `@rustev/rustev-wasm`. No API, export, crate name, container image or GitHub location changes. Ratified by the owner on 2026-10-25 (A-56).\n",
